meta {
  name: Get Price
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/price/AAPL
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Get Current Price

  Returns the latest price and snapshot data for any stock, backed by the Webull
  v3 Data API endpoint GET /market-data/stocks/snapshots/list.

  ## Path parameter
  - `{ticker}` — equity symbol, case-insensitive (e.g. AAPL). Does NOT need to be
    in the watchlist — any US stock symbol works.

  ## Responses
  - `200` — { ticker, price, open, high, low, preClose, volume, change,
    changeRatio, snapshot (raw), timestamp }
  - `404` — no snapshot returned for the symbol
  - `502` — Webull error; includes `webullError` (httpStatus + rawResponse)

  ## Note
  Requires an active market-data subscription for US stocks (Webull returns 403
  without one).
}
